common_en.txt.gz lists the alphabetic English words of 4 or more letters
whose Zipf frequency is 3.0 or higher in the data of wordfreq 3.1.1 by
Robyn Speer (https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq).

That data is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). common_en.txt.gz is
distributed under the same license.

To regenerate the file, run scripts/common_words.py.
